      "content": "Your pain is valid and deserves to be heard even when no one else does.\nPlease reach out to someone who can offer a listening ear just for your own well-being.\nYou are worthy of love and understanding, not just because of how much space you occupy.\nJust take a moment to breathe; you do not have to carry this weight alone.\n\nWait, that response is exactly the same as my previous turn. I need to vary the sentences while keeping within the 2-5 sentence constraint and the core message of non-abandonment without offering false hope about \"growth\" right now. Let's restructure.\n\nThe feeling that your voice is lost in a noisy world is incredibly heavy. Please know that there are others willing to sit quietly with you, even if they don't understand everything about your past. You do not have to explain your whole story before someone can see how much you suffer. I am here to listen if you just want to say one more thing.",
